tRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"1春，正月，甲寅朔，日有食之。魏舒稱疾，固請遜位，以劇陽子罷。舒所爲，必先行而後言，遜位之際，莫有知者。衞瓘與舒書曰：「每與足下共論此事，日日未果，可謂『瞻之在前，忽焉在後』矣。」","content_fanyi":"春季，正月，甲寅朔日，发生日食。魏舒声称患病，坚决请求退位，以剧阳子的爵位被免去官职。魏舒行事，总是先做了然后再说，因此退位时没有人知道。卫瓘写信给魏舒说：“每次与您共同讨论此事，天天都没有结果，真可说‘看着就在前面，忽然又落在后面’了。”","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，甲寅朔，日有食之。魏舒称疾，固请逊位，以剧阳子罢。舒所为，必先行而后言，逊位之际，莫有知者。衞瓘与舒书曰：「每与足下共论此事，日日未果，可谓『瞻之在前，忽焉在后』矣。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":6987,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9d089d0d-db0e-11ef-aa5c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"是否派兵拦截晋军护送扶余王子","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_9D089D1FDB0E11EFAD0AA0D3651F611F_02"}],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"武帝","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"9d089d21-db0e-11ef-a012-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"南蠻","place_name_jianti_auto":"南蛮","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"9d089d22-db0e-11ef-849b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"襄陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄阳","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"9d089d23-db0e-11ef-843d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西戎","place_name_jianti_auto":"西戎","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"9d089d24-db0e-11ef-95c5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長安","place_name_jianti_auto":"长安","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"9d089d25-db0e-11ef-b011-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南夷","place_name_jianti_auto":"南夷","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"9d089d26-db0e-11ef-a2b3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"寧州","place_name_jianti_auto":"宁州","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"9d089d27-db0e-11ef-9a3d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東夷","place_name_jianti_auto":"东夷","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"9d089d28-db0e-11ef-b947-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"遼東","place_name_jianti_auto":"辽东","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"9d089d29-db0e-11ef-a939-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"帥，讀曰率；下同。見，賢遍翻。見人，謂見存之人也。龕，口含翻。晉志曰：武帝置南蠻校尉於襄陽，西戎校尉於長安，南夷校尉於寧州；東夷校尉，蓋亦帝所置，治遼東。","note_content_jianti_auto":"帅，读曰率；下同。见，贤遍翻。见人，谓见存之人也。龛，口含翻。晋志曰：武帝置南蛮校尉于襄阳，西戎校尉于长安，南夷校尉于宁州；东夷校尉，盖亦帝所置，治辽东。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"9d089d20-db0e-11ef-bbd9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9d089d2c-db0e-11ef-a383-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"9d089d2d-db0e-11ef-8af7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"魏、晉之間，方鎭各置督護，領兵之官也。沈，持林翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"魏、晋之间，方镇各置督护，领兵之官也。沈，持林翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"9d089d2b-db0e-11ef-92bd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"東夷校尉","official_note":"東夷校尉是晉朝設置的官職，負責管理東北地區的少數民族事務，此處何龕擔任此職，依羅向其請求援助以恢復扶餘國。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"請援於東夷校尉何龕","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"d5095792-f33b-45c3-966e-2c9dabe685d4"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"督護","official_note":"督護是晉朝及後世常見的軍事官職，負責監督和護衛軍隊，此處賈沈擔任督護，率兵護送依羅回扶餘。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"龕遣督護賈沈將兵送之","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"23a29c56-a6a5-4513-8374-708de1b73882"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":269,"link_death_year":333,"link_td_description":"慕容廆，字弈洛瓌，昌黎棘城（今辽宁义县）人。晋朝时鲜卑人，慕容部首领慕容涉归之子，前燕奠基人慕容皝之父。其孙慕容儁建立前燕之后，追尊武宣皇帝。吐谷浑第一代首领慕容吐谷浑是其庶兄。","link_td_id":"Q10000872","link_td_numb