孙丁","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"9d089d3b-db0e-11ef-8818-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"9d089d1f-db0e-11ef-ad0a-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"kān","source_anchor_text":"夷校尉何龕龕遣督護","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":36,"text":"龕","tongjian_id":"b6a2a65a-9f26-58e7-970a-0c024c8e62dd"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"遼東","place_name_jianti_auto":"辽东","resolved_place_entity_id":281,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"9d089d34-db0e-11ef-904c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東夷","place_name_jianti_auto":"东夷","resolved_place_entity_id":976,"start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"9d089d35-db0e-11ef-96bc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"扶餘","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶余","resolved_place_entity_id":2869,"start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"9d089d3c-db0e-11ef-a7b3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十、女真（卷三十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"永和二年时，夫余为百济所侵，西徙近燕。慕容皝遣其子霝袭之...","context_before":"...年，夫余顺命助汉，击败高句骊、濊貊。永康元年，复寇玄菟。","source_end_index":343,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"3fe01127-2b12-59be-a253-062c37ee28c9","source_start_index":286,"source_text":"晋太康六年，鲜卑慕容廆东击夫余，夫余王依虑自杀，子弟走保沃沮，廆平其国城，驱万余人而归。明年，依虑子依罗复还旧国。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/十、女真（卷三十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"2夏，慕容廆寇遼東，故扶餘王依慮子依羅求帥見人還復舊國，請援於東夷校尉何龕，龕遣督護賈沈將兵送之。廆遣其將孫丁帥騎邀之於路，沈力戰，斬丁，遂復扶餘。","content_fanyi":"夏季，慕容廆侵犯辽东，已故扶余王依虑的儿子依罗请求率领幸存的部众返回并恢复旧国，向东夷校尉何龛请求援助，何龛派遣督护贾沈率兵护送他。慕容廆派他的部将孙丁率领骑兵在路上截击，贾沈奋力作战，斩杀孙丁，终于恢复了扶余国。","content_jianti_auto":"2夏，慕容廆寇辽东，故扶余王依虑子依罗求帅见人还复旧国，请援于东夷校尉何龛，龛遣督护贾沈将兵送之。廆遣其将孙丁帅骑邀之于路，沈力战，斩丁，遂复扶余。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":6988,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"9d089d1f-db0e-11ef-ad0a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_book