e5b-db0e-11ef-99ba-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"自泰始以來，鮮卑慕容、拓拔二部日以強盛，故史著其世。","note_content_jianti_auto":"自泰始以来，鲜卑慕容、拓拔二部日以强盛，故史著其世。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"9d0a5e58-db0e-11ef-994c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":286,"link_td_description":"拓跋悉鹿，中国西晋初年时索头部鲜卑族领袖，277年至286年在位，是南北朝时期北魏皇帝的先祖。","link_td_id":"Q10005484","link_td_number_id":383480,"people_name":"拓拔悉鹿","people_name_jianti_auto":"拓拔悉鹿","people_xingming":"拓跋悉鹿","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"9d0a5e5c-db0e-11ef-80bf-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":293,"link_td_description":"拓跋绰，中国西晋时期索头部鲜卑族领袖，286年至293年在位，是南北朝时期北魏皇帝的先祖。其父为拓跋力微，拓跋沙漠汗、拓跋悉鹿、拓跋禄官皆为其兄弟。286年，因其兄悉鹿去世而继位。《魏书·序记》载其“雄武有智略”。293年，鲜卑宇文部首领宇文莫槐为属下所杀，莫槐之弟宇文普拨继立为首领。拓跋绰将女儿嫁给普拨之子宇文丘不勤。同年拓跋绰去世，其侄即沙漠汗之子拓跋弗继立。北魏道武帝拓跋珪称帝时，将其追谥为平皇帝。","link_td_id":"Q10008808","link_td_number_id":383484,"people_name":"綽","people_name_jianti_auto":"绰","people_xingming":"拓跋绰","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"9d0a5e5e-db0e-11ef-8190-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鮮卑","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲜卑","resolved_place_entity_id":218,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9d0a5e5d-db0e-11ef-8b61-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"6是歲，鮮卑拓拔悉鹿卒，弟綽立。","content_fanyi":"这一年，鲜卑拓跋悉鹿去世，其弟拓跋绰继位。","content_jianti_auto":"6是岁，鲜卑拓拔悉鹿卒，弟绰立。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":6992,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9d0a5e56-db0e-11ef-bf41-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"七年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"七年","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"9d089d0b-db0e-11ef-847a-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（丙午、二八六）","year_int":286},"message":"success","success":true}